WEBVTT

00:06.500 --> 00:09.375
[The following program is a true story.]

00:09.929 --> 00:12.336
[At least some of it is... untrue.]

00:12.500 --> 00:13.875
[True.]

00:16.765 --> 00:17.306
Sau!

00:17.331 --> 00:18.165
[5:30PM - New Year's Eve]

00:18.190 --> 00:19.000
Where is Mai?

00:19.382 --> 00:21.179
Give the phone to her! Where is she?

00:21.392 --> 00:23.514
I will cut out your tongue!
Shut your mouth!

00:23.541 --> 00:25.256
My nephew is a cop! You...

00:26.046 --> 00:28.130
Bitch! I have not finished.

00:35.556 --> 00:37.542
Go find Long!

01:05.375 --> 01:08.750
[6PM - New Year's Eve]

01:14.025 --> 01:14.733
Co!

01:15.320 --> 01:16.180
Co!

01:16.205 --> 01:17.978
You’re the one behind this, aren’t you?

01:18.135 --> 01:19.236
Open the door!

01:19.423 --> 01:20.507
Open the door!

01:21.666 --> 01:22.561
Co!

01:25.541 --> 01:26.625
Where’s my daughter?

02:00.916 --> 02:03.416
MISSING: EVE OF TET

02:04.916 --> 02:09.500
Episode 2: Hoa

02:12.203 --> 02:14.494
[1 week before tet]

02:25.892 --> 02:26.601
Oh...

02:26.976 --> 02:28.155
Why are you back early?

02:28.861 --> 02:30.445
I wanted to talk with you about something.

02:33.311 --> 02:34.649
Where did you go all morning?

02:35.751 --> 02:36.876
A customer called.

02:46.806 --> 02:48.274
Is everything ok?

02:49.750 --> 02:52.750
You haven't been back for a while.
Customers get crazy before Tet.

02:54.375 --> 02:55.250
Daisies?

02:55.720 --> 02:57.995
These are so common.
Tien’s house is full of them.

02:58.020 --> 02:59.932
These aren't like Tien's daisies at all.

03:00.304 --> 03:02.015
These have purple flowers.

03:02.062 --> 03:04.383
Their petals are pointy like fireworks.

03:05.838 --> 03:07.255
I'm planting them for dad.

03:07.695 --> 03:08.570
For what?

03:09.469 --> 03:12.127
It's a waste.
He doesn't care about flowers.

03:12.289 --> 03:13.410
I know.

03:13.789 --> 03:15.462
But he always injures himself.

03:15.711 --> 03:21.119
I plan to soak the flowers in alcohol
to make medicine for Dad's cuts.

03:21.144 --> 03:23.394
I can also sell the leftovers online.

03:24.252 --> 03:25.401
How smart!

03:25.540 --> 03:27.373
I spend all this money
to send you to the city for college,

03:27.506 --> 03:29.157
just so that you can
peddle medicine online?

03:29.642 --> 03:31.066
I want a refund!

03:33.353 --> 03:34.257
Nope.

03:34.484 --> 03:35.854
I like pharmacy school!

03:41.258 --> 03:42.133
You do?

03:42.445 --> 03:44.548
Then why did you come back
before your term is over?

03:58.422 --> 04:02.338
[6AM - New Year’s Day]

04:10.469 --> 04:12.023
Dad! I found mom!

04:14.962 --> 04:17.151
- Go inside.
- Yes, Dad.

04:20.436 --> 04:22.164
Long is very upset at you.

04:23.577 --> 04:25.507
He thinks you lied to him.

04:26.453 --> 04:29.017
How? Why would he say that?

04:29.548 --> 04:31.738
You were supposed to stop livestreaming,

04:31.762 --> 04:34.007
after they agreed to file
the missing person form.

04:35.767 --> 04:37.476
Because you were unreasonable.

04:39.461 --> 04:40.332
Hey.

04:40.546 --> 04:42.762
I never agreed to that!

04:43.015 --> 04:45.341
I only agreed to stop
bad-mouthing the cops.

04:45.656 --> 04:48.134
It’s because of my livestream
that they agreed to help us.

04:48.603 --> 04:50.245
If you expect me to stop
the livestreaming,

04:50.269 --> 04:52.086
then you are the unreasonable one!

05:00.070 --> 05:01.514
I beg of you, Mother.

05:01.712 --> 05:02.916
Please stop.

05:03.336 --> 05:04.502
And do what?

05:05.218 --> 05:07.242
Sit and do nothing, like you?

05:09.304 --> 05:11.217
Go and look for our daughter!

05:11.288 --> 05:13.011
Stop sitting here judging me!

05:34.728 --> 05:35.789
Mai...

05:54.906 --> 05:57.646
It's 7am on the first day of Tet.

05:59.259 --> 06:00.633
These flowers...

06:00.970 --> 06:03.304
Were planted by my daughter, Mai.

06:04.171 --> 06:06.171
She took great care of them.

06:06.484 --> 06:08.484
Just so that they would bloom
on the first day of Tet.

06:15.398 --> 06:16.439
Mai...

06:18.069 --> 06:20.110
Your flowers have bloomed.

06:21.264 --> 06:23.476
I will take good care of them...

06:23.640 --> 06:25.339
Until the day you come home.

06:26.164 --> 06:31.053
I will pluck the blossom...
Soak them in alcohol to make medicine...

06:31.538 --> 06:33.350
For your Dad to use.

06:34.234 --> 06:36.484
Just like you had wanted.

06:38.897 --> 06:39.648
Here...

06:39.750 --> 06:41.000
Hey! Don’t you want it?

06:41.025 --> 06:44.502
She always takes care of
her parents and siblings.

06:45.405 --> 06:49.085
She thinks her daughter Mai
is so innocent!

06:49.491 --> 06:51.062
Even with my nephew.

06:51.663 --> 06:53.397
Long is a police officer.

06:53.422 --> 06:58.054
The day his mother died,
my husband and I took him in.

06:58.220 --> 07:00.007
We loved him like our own.

07:00.248 --> 07:00.998
Honey

07:01.999 --> 07:04.996
Look at this.
Your aunt has no limits!

07:05.021 --> 07:09.623
It's good to have the support of
the police, but they, too, need help.

07:09.648 --> 07:10.646
That is why...

07:10.820 --> 07:12.906
For the next 36 hours,

07:13.174 --> 07:16.222
I am offering money to anyone
with information about Mai.

07:16.259 --> 07:20.586
But the information has to prove helpful
in helping us to find Mai.

07:20.611 --> 07:22.744
I will pay 500k VND.

07:22.769 --> 07:23.777
I already told you!

07:23.801 --> 07:26.230
It's the first of Tet,
I’m not buying anything.

07:26.447 --> 07:27.445
You want it or not?

07:27.564 --> 07:29.485
How about giving me 2 hits
for good luck?

07:29.859 --> 07:30.909
Please.

07:31.624 --> 07:33.374
I’ve got some new spare parts...

07:34.117 --> 07:35.117
How about a trade?

07:38.290 --> 07:40.749
The first 48 hours is the most important.

07:41.625 --> 07:42.618
Party time!

07:42.648 --> 07:44.773
I will pay each person 500k.

07:45.257 --> 07:46.382
Let me repeat.

07:46.611 --> 07:50.704
If the information leads to finding Mai,
then I will pay 500,000 VND.

07:56.187 --> 07:57.426
We’re done, honey.

08:03.023 --> 08:08.064
Mom... Do we have enough money
to pay everyone?

08:09.109 --> 08:10.567
Weren't you listening?

08:11.267 --> 08:14.312
I will only pay if the information
helps us to find Mai.

08:16.445 --> 08:17.397
Okay.

08:21.041 --> 08:22.397
I can't believe it!

08:22.515 --> 08:25.808
I’ve stayed up all night scanning
these footage...for nothing!

08:26.585 --> 08:27.835
Just drop it.

08:28.258 --> 08:30.128
Start with the junkies.

08:30.304 --> 08:32.812
In what world would the junkies
ever talk to the police?

08:32.837 --> 08:34.863
And you think these
junkies are dumb enough

08:34.888 --> 08:37.754
to drive in front of a traffic cam
for you to catch?

08:38.517 --> 08:40.107
Here, start with this!

08:40.132 --> 08:41.005
Are you sure?

08:41.030 --> 08:43.445
Experience says so!
Just start here!

08:53.031 --> 08:56.016
I know it's a big ask,
but it’s my cousin who is missing.

08:56.041 --> 08:58.628
Please make copies
of the flyers I sent you,

08:58.652 --> 09:00.577
and help us post it
around your district.

09:00.602 --> 09:01.977
Yes, thank you.

09:03.375 --> 09:04.491
Happy New Year.

09:06.212 --> 09:07.962
Has the police already started
their search for Mai?

09:09.470 --> 09:10.179
Uncle.

09:10.655 --> 09:11.405
They have.

09:12.400 --> 09:14.827
We don't sit around and do nothing,
like Auntie said.

09:16.467 --> 09:18.128
She said the same to me.

09:18.452 --> 09:20.603
Your aunt can be harsh.

09:21.470 --> 09:22.551
Just then...

09:23.038 --> 09:25.082
I overheard talk about printing flyers.
What if...

09:25.107 --> 09:26.815
- I helped you passed them out...
- That’s okay, Uncle.

09:26.840 --> 09:28.251
You should go home and be with Hanh.

09:29.166 --> 09:32.141
If you really want to help me,
then please calm Auntie down.

09:32.166 --> 09:33.500
Keep her away from her phone.

09:56.656 --> 09:58.925
Hey! Are you done yet?

09:58.950 --> 10:00.124
How much longer?

10:00.908 --> 10:02.476
You got hot water down your pants
or something?

10:08.750 --> 10:10.683
What are you hiding in there?

10:10.861 --> 10:11.819
Dumb question!

10:11.977 --> 10:14.060
If you want a fix,
you gotta have cash!

10:14.383 --> 10:17.383
- Why can't I help you?
- Cause you’re a screw-up!

10:20.382 --> 10:22.177
You can’t see into here, can you?

10:22.517 --> 10:24.975
Yesterday you paid with sideview mirrors.

10:25.000 --> 10:26.416
You're hiding a bike in there!

10:27.559 --> 10:28.618
Damn!

10:31.791 --> 10:32.516
Bullshit!

10:32.541 --> 10:34.478
Why not just sell the whole thing?

10:34.503 --> 10:36.327
Why strip it for parts?

10:36.352 --> 10:38.774
Why don’t you shut your damn trap!

10:40.197 --> 10:41.077
Hey!

10:41.297 --> 10:42.984
I want my nunchakus back!

10:43.103 --> 10:44.353
You’ve kept them for long enough!

10:55.702 --> 10:56.512
Dan!

10:57.962 --> 10:58.796
What?

10:59.226 --> 11:00.663
The mother is livestreaming again

11:01.624 --> 11:02.893
Again?

11:03.492 --> 11:05.617
Urging folks to search
their neighbor's house again?

11:05.703 --> 11:08.362
She's offering money for
information about her daughter.

11:08.515 --> 11:09.804
Where's our money?

11:11.122 --> 11:12.435
Damn!

11:18.898 --> 11:20.314
Don't play dumb.

11:20.922 --> 11:22.422
Where is my money?

11:23.023 --> 11:24.887
Have you seen her livestream?

11:25.164 --> 11:26.558
You didn’t know?

11:27.031 --> 11:30.109
You get me my money...

11:30.345 --> 11:32.345
Before she gives it all away!

11:34.242 --> 11:36.464
Uncle 7, New District...

11:36.489 --> 11:37.777
Saw her at the market.

11:38.281 --> 11:40.734
Auntie 8... Saw her at the bus station.

11:41.374 --> 11:42.891
Okay... Go on.

11:42.916 --> 11:44.827
Mr. Chanh, the shopkeeper!

11:44.852 --> 11:48.242
- What about him?
- He said he’ll help us print the flyers!

11:48.267 --> 11:50.144
Even though it’s the Lunar New Year!

11:51.111 --> 11:54.001
We're not trying to sell real estate!
What good are flyers?

11:54.283 --> 11:55.117
Go on!

12:00.468 --> 12:02.009
Quick. Who's next?

12:03.234 --> 12:04.741
Miss 6...

12:04.937 --> 12:06.839
Called you a lot of bad names.

12:07.210 --> 12:09.960
She's dumb as a cow.
Don’t worry about her.

12:11.336 --> 12:12.340
Next!

12:15.679 --> 12:16.554
What is it?

12:20.528 --> 12:22.763
[It’s Your Ancestors. Call me now!]

12:32.092 --> 12:33.477
We have enough tips.

12:33.502 --> 12:34.836
Bring them over to Long.

12:35.736 --> 12:37.790
Go on! What are you waiting for?

12:38.978 --> 12:40.485
Go on!

12:41.291 --> 12:42.588
Okay...

12:49.047 --> 12:50.797
[It’s Your Ancestors. Call me now!]

12:57.016 --> 12:57.925
Co!

12:58.382 --> 12:59.108
Co!

12:59.225 --> 13:00.725
You’re the one behind this, aren’t you?

13:00.750 --> 13:01.250
[6PM - New Year's Eve]

13:01.275 --> 13:03.650
Open the door! Open it!
[6PM - New Year's Eve]

13:04.673 --> 13:05.523
Co!

13:07.236 --> 13:08.945
- Where is my daughter?
- Where is my money?

13:08.992 --> 13:09.864
Damn!

13:10.499 --> 13:13.539
If I find out that you’re connected
to my daughter being missing...

13:13.986 --> 13:15.045
I'll burn this place down!

13:15.070 --> 13:17.343
Do you know what will happen
if you don't have my money?

13:17.368 --> 13:18.600
I told you that I don’t have it!

13:18.625 --> 13:21.641
Then you better start looking for it!
Do you know whose money it is?

13:21.666 --> 13:23.230
Even if it belongs to your ancestors!

13:23.254 --> 13:25.034
I only give a damn
about finding my daughter!

13:25.059 --> 13:26.059
Do you know where she is?

13:26.084 --> 13:26.799
No!

13:27.312 --> 13:28.112
Screw you!

13:35.250 --> 13:37.250
[It’s Your Ancestors. Call me now!]

13:46.382 --> 13:48.718
[3 days before tet]

14:00.844 --> 14:01.885
Mom.

14:03.720 --> 14:05.345
Are we having money trouble?

14:06.304 --> 14:07.508
Why would you ask that?

14:09.908 --> 14:11.117
Because...

14:12.124 --> 14:14.341
I noticed that you’ve
been angry all week.

14:14.611 --> 14:16.305
Whenever you get that way...

14:16.330 --> 14:17.705
It's about money.

14:18.452 --> 14:20.265
Your dad also makes me angry.

14:20.486 --> 14:22.718
I caught him stealing the other day.

14:25.287 --> 14:26.296
Really?

14:29.594 --> 14:31.969
Probably to buy booze again.

14:32.282 --> 14:34.241
I need a new place to hide money.

14:34.604 --> 14:37.188
We won't be a dime left
if he gets his hands on it.

14:43.281 --> 14:44.174
Mom...

14:46.671 --> 14:48.587
I really don't get it.

14:50.726 --> 14:54.115
Why are you so hard on him?
Calling him dumb.

14:55.827 --> 14:57.717
If you hate him that much,

14:58.000 --> 14:59.743
then why did you marry him?

15:02.541 --> 15:04.336
It's not that I hate him.

15:04.820 --> 15:06.945
I just don't respect him.

15:12.087 --> 15:15.134
And you? Are you planning
on getting married?

15:15.640 --> 15:17.306
Why did you leave school
to come home?

15:20.531 --> 15:22.322
I'm only 20, Mom.

15:25.516 --> 15:26.456
Fine.

15:27.914 --> 15:29.164
You're old enough.

15:29.539 --> 15:30.885
I will tell you.

15:32.438 --> 15:33.688
The truth is...

15:35.054 --> 15:36.929
He got me pregnant.

15:39.922 --> 15:40.713
Listen.

15:42.335 --> 15:44.125
Don't go telling Hanh, ok?

15:46.180 --> 15:47.042
Sure.

15:47.124 --> 15:48.749
I won’t tell Hanh.

15:50.017 --> 15:52.851
As long as you don't ask me
why I came back early?

15:58.916 --> 16:02.541
[10AM - New Year’s Day]

16:11.928 --> 16:14.678
So you’d rather give your money away
instead of pay me?

16:14.757 --> 16:17.219
I'm trying to find my daughter, idiot!

16:17.244 --> 16:18.249
Hey, hey.

16:18.618 --> 16:20.352
Better watch your tone with me!

16:20.531 --> 16:22.496
If you ever want to see
your daughter again.

16:22.882 --> 16:23.882
So it was you!

16:24.265 --> 16:25.485
You took my daughter!

16:25.665 --> 16:27.914
I will call the police
to drag your ass off!

16:27.939 --> 16:29.189
Go ahead.

16:29.214 --> 16:33.266
When they do, I'll tell them
that you still owe me 500 mil.

16:33.291 --> 16:36.125
You kidnapped my daughter
just because you want your money back?

16:36.312 --> 16:40.125
I already told you! It's been 12 years!
I don't have the money! It's all gone!

16:40.150 --> 16:41.634
I have no money!

16:41.659 --> 16:43.483
Then you have no daughter either!

16:43.641 --> 16:46.195
Give me my money,
or say goodbye to your daughter!

16:49.047 --> 16:50.297
Co!

16:51.492 --> 16:52.226
Mom!

16:52.251 --> 16:53.459
What happened, mother?

16:56.460 --> 16:58.225
What's wrong with you, mom?

16:59.244 --> 17:00.955
Hanh, get your mother some water!

17:02.187 --> 17:04.871
It's okay. Sit down.
Don’t worry.

17:05.062 --> 17:09.406
Have some rest, Mom.
Me and Dad will find Mai for you.

17:10.095 --> 17:11.054
How?

17:11.079 --> 17:12.704
I’m heading over there now!

17:13.575 --> 17:14.500
Go where?

17:14.525 --> 17:15.718
Chanh's place.

17:15.843 --> 17:17.792
We’ll print the flyers and pass them out!

17:18.070 --> 17:18.986
Oh...

17:20.561 --> 17:21.701
Flyers...

17:23.031 --> 17:26.542
Mom thinks printing flyers is useless

17:27.007 --> 17:28.548
No, it's a good idea.

17:29.375 --> 17:30.912
- You should go now.
- Yeah.

17:30.937 --> 17:33.260
I'll go get Mai's photo,
then I’m off.

17:33.285 --> 17:34.160
Yeah.

17:43.572 --> 17:45.578
Have you given the tips to Long yet?

17:45.603 --> 17:46.676
Yes, I have.

17:46.701 --> 17:48.056
You did?

17:48.726 --> 17:50.752
Didn’t you want me to do that?

17:51.101 --> 17:52.726
Uh.... No.

17:55.540 --> 17:56.874
What did he do with it?

18:06.562 --> 18:07.635
What did he do?

18:08.444 --> 18:10.091
He... Put it away...

18:15.351 --> 18:16.226
Hanh.

18:16.789 --> 18:19.026
Go on and help your Dad.

18:19.398 --> 18:20.963
I want to rest a bit.

18:25.632 --> 18:26.674
Go on!

18:28.382 --> 18:29.572
Okay.

18:56.400 --> 18:57.910
Damn you, Co!

18:57.935 --> 18:59.601
Pick up your damn phone!

19:16.090 --> 19:17.138
Auntie!

19:17.906 --> 19:19.322
Is there anyone home?

19:22.663 --> 19:24.080
Auntie Hoa! Auntie Hoa!

19:24.595 --> 19:25.778
Auntie Hoa!

19:28.080 --> 19:29.711
Maybe they went out looking for Mai.

19:30.587 --> 19:31.421
Yes.

19:34.991 --> 19:37.074
Maybe Vinh had a heart attack.

19:37.249 --> 19:39.560
The whole family had to rush
him to the hospital.

19:40.078 --> 19:42.466
Maybe the killer found their address,

19:42.491 --> 19:44.197
Robbed them, then killed them all.

19:44.222 --> 19:45.465
They have no money.

19:45.611 --> 19:47.350
What if the killer is a woman?

19:47.375 --> 19:48.487
Stop speculating.

19:51.492 --> 19:53.179
It's him and his bulging eyes!

19:54.299 --> 19:55.266
I'm sorry

19:55.291 --> 19:56.967
- Let me go check!
- Hey, this punk...

19:58.421 --> 20:00.047
Why are you all here?

20:02.156 --> 20:04.230
The list of tips I gave you.
Were they useful?

20:12.625 --> 20:13.250
Here.

20:13.900 --> 20:18.285
This dossier contains a list of
known felons and ex-cons.

20:18.310 --> 20:22.099
Look through it and see if you

20:22.123 --> 20:25.101
or your family have crossed path
with any of them.

20:25.500 --> 20:27.087
Usually, in kidnapping cases,

20:27.112 --> 20:29.134
the culprit is someone the victim knows,

20:29.159 --> 20:30.450
Or the family knows.

20:31.219 --> 20:34.255
Are you saying... that my daughter
has been kidnapped?

20:36.382 --> 20:37.507
No, Auntie.

20:38.150 --> 20:41.729
We just want to know if you
recognize anyone in the file.

20:43.000 --> 20:44.000
Please have a look, first.

21:04.392 --> 21:05.309
What’s wrong?

21:05.851 --> 21:06.976
Did you recognize someone?

21:09.442 --> 21:10.091
[Finding Relative]

21:11.177 --> 21:12.528
[Finding Relative
Ha Thi Mai]

21:19.093 --> 21:24.766
Makes no sense that out of the whole list,
she didn’t recognize a single one of them!

21:24.791 --> 21:27.391
Maybe she's been threatened.
She'll die if she talks to us.

21:27.416 --> 21:29.490
Maybe she's covering for Vinh!

21:29.515 --> 21:34.016
- Maybe he got into a drunken accident!
- Or he fought back and they broke his leg!

21:34.041 --> 21:35.507
- Maybe...
- That’s enough!

21:41.650 --> 21:42.650
It’s New Year’s Day.

21:43.422 --> 21:44.685
You two should get back to the station.

21:45.025 --> 21:47.453
There's bound to be a
drunken brawl happening.

21:47.478 --> 21:48.086
Yes.

21:49.538 --> 21:51.240
Maybe you should give me a ride back.

22:11.146 --> 22:12.209
[It’s Your Ancestors. Call me now!]

22:12.234 --> 22:13.240
[You have til the 3rd to get me 500mil,]

22:13.265 --> 22:15.314
[if you want to see
your daughter again.]

22:15.339 --> 22:16.198
[Your ancestors.]

22:24.655 --> 22:26.458
Please... Help me find my daughter.

22:26.483 --> 22:28.349
If there is any information,
please call me. Thank you so much.

22:28.451 --> 22:29.896
Please, help me.

22:29.929 --> 22:31.056
Please, my daughter is missing.

22:31.080 --> 22:32.458
If there is any information,
please call me.

22:47.265 --> 22:48.409
Go away!

22:48.434 --> 22:50.007
Hey! What are you doing?

22:50.032 --> 22:52.331
- What do you want? Huh?
- Dad, let's go.

23:22.641 --> 23:23.748
Please, miss!

23:23.773 --> 23:27.042
I know you're closed for Tet,
but please, I need your help!

23:27.375 --> 23:28.375
Miss!

23:38.126 --> 23:39.118
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

23:43.866 --> 23:46.220
Oooh what a beauty!

23:46.750 --> 23:48.000
That’s my future wife!

23:48.103 --> 23:48.826
Hey, guys.

23:48.851 --> 23:49.726
- What are you doing?
- What are you doing?

23:50.407 --> 23:51.523
What, old man?

23:51.548 --> 23:53.318
- What do you want!
- Please don’t hit my dad.

23:53.343 --> 23:55.626
Please stop hitting him!

23:55.711 --> 23:57.397
- Please, mister!
- Let me go!

24:01.125 --> 24:04.387
[Stop calling! The only way you’ll see
your daughter again is to pay me 500mil!]

24:04.412 --> 24:05.750
[Your ancestors.]

24:16.710 --> 24:18.679
Why are you pawning your house?

24:19.460 --> 24:21.912
To pay for the folks
who sent in tips.

24:21.937 --> 24:23.468
Don't waste your money!

24:23.687 --> 24:25.872
It’s not certaint that Mai is missing!

24:25.897 --> 24:28.478
I saw you two fighting yesterday.

24:28.503 --> 24:31.350
Maybe she ran away
to send you a message.

24:31.375 --> 24:33.628
You know how kids are these days!

24:34.819 --> 24:36.267
No one asked for your opinion.

24:36.830 --> 24:38.764
How much you want for the house?

24:39.016 --> 24:39.791
Hey!

24:40.230 --> 24:42.391
Don't you raise your voice at me.

24:42.416 --> 24:44.416
You're the one that needs my money.

24:44.593 --> 24:46.121
Can you loan me the money or not?

24:49.695 --> 24:50.566
No.

24:51.650 --> 24:56.564
You think this whole world
owes your something.

24:56.695 --> 24:58.067
But it doesn’t!

24:58.453 --> 25:01.829
Maybe Mai could be missing for real.

25:01.854 --> 25:06.563
Or maybe Mai left home in order to get away
from you and your big, bad mouth!

25:31.720 --> 25:32.970
What happened to your father, Hanh?

25:33.312 --> 25:35.915
Some drunk men were being rude.

25:36.321 --> 25:38.016
You got into a drunken brawl?

25:38.041 --> 25:38.875
Not at all!

25:39.046 --> 25:41.912
Dad wasn't drunk, the men were.

25:41.937 --> 25:44.175
Weren't you handing out flyers?
How did this happend?

25:44.200 --> 25:45.793
Because... Ouch!

25:45.818 --> 25:46.818
Sorry, Dad.

25:47.264 --> 25:51.850
They were being rude with Mai's photo,
and saying this and that. I had to...

25:51.875 --> 25:53.625
Damn! Those bastards!

26:00.250 --> 26:01.291
What’s happening, Mother?

26:02.180 --> 26:04.692
I have to protect my daughter’s honor.
That’s what’s happening.

26:05.249 --> 26:07.036
Hanh. Help me livestream.

26:07.061 --> 26:07.942
Yes.

26:12.742 --> 26:13.871
Quickly!

26:22.757 --> 26:24.172
For those who don't know.

26:24.422 --> 26:26.071
My name is Do Thi Hoa.

26:26.743 --> 26:29.082
My daughter, Ha Thi Mai...

26:29.124 --> 26:31.308
Has been missing for 36 hours.

26:31.611 --> 26:32.573
I know.

26:32.598 --> 26:34.641
Although, there’s a lot of support
for my family...

26:34.666 --> 26:37.037
Sau! She's livestreaming again!

26:37.062 --> 26:39.353
There are still those who
like to bad-mouth my daughter.

26:39.866 --> 26:42.853
Those people should be
ashamed of themselves!

26:42.878 --> 26:44.253
36 hours ago...

26:44.593 --> 26:46.879
We all thought she was missing.

26:46.904 --> 26:48.410
Until 10 minutes ago...

26:48.435 --> 26:50.410
When we received this text

26:52.837 --> 26:54.671
You have until the 3rd...

26:54.837 --> 26:58.433
to deliver 500 million VND,
if you want your daughter back home safely.

26:59.078 --> 27:00.236
Dad...

27:00.374 --> 27:01.416
Mai...

27:01.441 --> 27:03.354
My daughter has been kidnapped!

27:04.619 --> 27:07.475
- I repeat. My daughter has been kidnapped!
- I told you! She was kidnapped!

27:07.500 --> 27:09.625
- I said it first!
- No, I said it first!

27:09.650 --> 27:11.725
- I guessed it first, sir.
- I’m the one who guessed it!

27:11.750 --> 27:14.375
Sau! My daughter has been kidnapped,
and it’s your fault!

27:14.648 --> 27:16.503
Did you all hear it clearly?

27:16.528 --> 27:19.498
I say it again. You should all
be ashamed of yourselves!

27:19.523 --> 27:21.064
My daughter, Ha Thi Mai...

27:21.089 --> 27:22.462
36 hours ago...

27:22.487 --> 27:24.422
- Our family though that Mai was missing,
- What should we do?

27:24.446 --> 27:27.725
but 10 minutes ago,
we received this message.

27:27.750 --> 27:31.303
You have til the 3rd to deliver me 500 mil,

27:31.328 --> 27:33.332
- if you want your daughter back...
- You should go.

27:33.357 --> 27:36.090
My daughter had been kidnapped.
Did you hear that?

27:45.000 --> 27:46.153
Pick up the phone!

27:46.697 --> 27:48.508
- Hi, Long.
- What happened to your face, Uncle?

27:50.129 --> 27:51.137
Who hit you?

27:54.166 --> 27:55.763
You bitch! Pick up!

27:57.996 --> 27:59.340
It's not a big problem.

28:01.687 --> 28:04.651
You see? Ever since the livestream,

28:04.676 --> 28:06.850
so many people have been calling
and texting non-stop!

28:06.875 --> 28:08.041
Isn't that what you wanted?

28:08.066 --> 28:09.425
Yes. I wanted that.

28:09.450 --> 28:11.870
Yes, I wanted them to shut their mouths,
and stop trash-talking Mai!

28:11.895 --> 28:13.817
There! Look at your uncle.

28:13.842 --> 28:16.285
What did he do to deserve such a beating?

28:16.310 --> 28:17.291
Who hit you?

28:17.376 --> 28:18.350
Tell me.

28:18.375 --> 28:20.303
- I'll haul to the station!
- It's fine.

28:20.328 --> 28:21.704
They were just drunk.

28:23.666 --> 28:25.750
They asked for 500 million as ransom.

28:25.992 --> 28:27.854
Where would I find that kind of money?

28:28.242 --> 28:29.975
Show me the text message first.

28:30.000 --> 28:31.625
I will try to trace the number.

28:37.166 --> 28:37.875
Umm...

28:38.007 --> 28:40.798
I only have the screenshot
of the text message left.

28:41.321 --> 28:42.656
Where is the original text?

28:42.681 --> 28:46.725
There were so many junk texts,
I had to delete them all.

28:46.766 --> 28:49.100
I must havve deleted the
original text by mistake.

28:49.125 --> 28:50.097
It's true, cousin.

28:50.122 --> 28:53.795
Ever since Mom offered money,
her phone blew up with messages!

28:53.820 --> 28:56.207
Even Miss Sau texted Mom with insults!

29:41.195 --> 29:42.476
What are you doing?

29:44.499 --> 29:46.140
I'm bringing her some porridge.

29:46.773 --> 29:48.965
Did I bring a dog for you to raise?

29:49.094 --> 29:50.040
Get out.

29:50.299 --> 29:52.617
- At least we should give her some...
- Get out!

29:54.463 --> 29:55.363
Auntie!

29:56.851 --> 29:58.790
They're connecting your phone
to the laptop.

29:59.695 --> 30:00.975
Hear me out, first.

30:01.000 --> 30:02.729
This is the only way that we can record

30:02.753 --> 30:05.467
all subsequent texts and
calls on your phone.

30:05.492 --> 30:08.592
If they contact you again, you just have
to answer and put it on speaker phone.

30:08.864 --> 30:09.864
Is that clear?

30:10.328 --> 30:13.201
This means I can’t use the phone anymore?
How will I livestream?

30:13.226 --> 30:15.101
- Auntie...
- Don't worry, Mom.

30:15.320 --> 30:17.166
You can use my phone.

30:21.991 --> 30:23.783
Are they really looking for Mai?

30:23.808 --> 30:24.719
Yes.

30:25.132 --> 30:28.382
They have dispatched many officers,
in many districts, to look for Mai.

30:28.492 --> 30:29.906
But now...

30:30.080 --> 30:31.214
They have to stop.

30:31.239 --> 30:33.197
What? Why are they stopping?

30:33.222 --> 30:35.097
Mai hasn’t been found,
so why not keep searching?

30:35.122 --> 30:36.413
Please listen, Auntie.

30:36.438 --> 30:38.844
Now that Mai is no longer missing,

30:39.290 --> 30:40.702
but has been kidnapped,

30:40.874 --> 30:42.499
The police has been dispatched here.

30:44.515 --> 30:45.838
So they’re staying here?

30:45.863 --> 30:47.172
For how long?

30:47.197 --> 30:48.322
Until Mai is found.

30:56.498 --> 30:58.187
Hey! Where are you going?

30:58.225 --> 30:58.779
Where is Dan?

30:58.804 --> 31:00.475
- What do you want? Hey!
- Out of my way!

31:00.500 --> 31:01.291
- Dan! Dan!
- Hey!

31:01.316 --> 31:03.482
Dan! Dan! Abort! Abort!

31:04.648 --> 31:06.689
Abort! Send the girl
back to her mother!

31:07.478 --> 31:09.766
When I get my money, I will.

31:09.791 --> 31:12.842
I’m serious! She called the cops!
Where is the girl?

31:14.179 --> 31:17.248
Money first.
Then she goes free.

31:17.273 --> 31:19.897
Don't you understand?
She has no money!

31:20.054 --> 31:21.451
She called our bluff!

31:21.476 --> 31:24.225
Then she told the whole world
about the kidnapping!

31:24.250 --> 31:25.266
Do you understand?
Bring the girl out.

31:25.291 --> 31:26.000
Where is she?

31:26.843 --> 31:28.229
If she had called the cops...

31:28.257 --> 31:29.767
They would have cuffed you by now!

31:29.792 --> 31:31.359
You wouldn’t even be here.

31:32.194 --> 31:33.506
You idiot!

31:33.851 --> 31:36.475
We're all gonna get caught
because of idiots like you!

31:36.633 --> 31:38.588
I’m not going back to the slammer!

31:38.613 --> 31:41.000
Do you understand?
Are you listening, you fucking idiot!

31:41.025 --> 31:41.944
Damn you!

31:43.342 --> 31:44.133
Calm the fuck down!

31:45.147 --> 31:46.188
- You...
- You!

31:46.726 --> 31:49.572
Convinced me to kidnap that girl.

31:51.332 --> 31:52.606
If go to prison...

31:52.834 --> 31:54.401
It's because of you!

31:55.832 --> 31:57.248
You’re too chicken shit!

31:57.582 --> 31:58.707
Scared to you it yourself?

31:59.457 --> 32:00.926
Pay me my 50 mill!

32:01.457 --> 32:03.832
Then you can take her
wherever the fuck you want.

32:04.542 --> 32:05.654
50 mil?

32:05.863 --> 32:07.178
I get you money, you let her go?

32:08.066 --> 32:09.932
You got a burner sim?
Give it to me!

32:09.957 --> 32:12.282
She knows my number.
She won't answer!

32:12.307 --> 32:14.799
Do you have a burner sim?
Let me have it!

32:14.824 --> 32:15.557
Fuck!

32:15.582 --> 32:16.543
What's going on?

32:16.568 --> 32:18.402
Do you have burner sim?
Let me borrow it!

32:18.490 --> 32:19.901
Let me use your phone!

32:20.363 --> 32:21.704
Your phone! Now!

32:34.806 --> 32:36.024
Wait, Auntie!

32:39.923 --> 32:41.462
We're out of innards, Auntie 2!

32:43.655 --> 32:45.355
Fuck. She hung up.

32:48.173 --> 32:49.007
What's wrong, Auntie?

32:49.266 --> 32:51.842
Uh... That was Auntie 2, my regular,
who buys chicken innards from me.

32:53.673 --> 32:54.715
Oh, really?

33:08.453 --> 33:09.898
I said we’re out of innards!

33:09.923 --> 33:12.674
Stop calling! Keep the damn line clear,
so the police can do their job!

33:17.553 --> 33:19.105
Oh shit! The cops.

33:22.485 --> 33:25.041
At least she didn't rat you out.

33:25.748 --> 33:29.373
Now, your only task is
to find me 50mil.

33:35.648 --> 33:36.982
Why did you drag me in here?

33:37.007 --> 33:38.919
I don't want those people here!

33:38.944 --> 33:40.944
They even took my phone!

33:41.108 --> 33:42.257
That’s because you deleted those texts.

33:42.281 --> 33:44.257
They want you keep them
on the line a bit longer

33:44.282 --> 33:45.600
to track their location.

33:45.624 --> 33:46.982
Why don't you ever do as you’re told?

33:47.007 --> 33:48.632
He’s not one who kidnapped Mai!

33:50.423 --> 33:52.419
I already told you!
Auntie 2 is my regular customer!

33:52.444 --> 33:54.418
- Why don't you believe me?
- Mother...

33:54.443 --> 33:56.363
Do you want me to take you
to Auntie 2’s house?

33:56.522 --> 33:58.523
- Mother...
- I hung up to keep the line open.

33:58.548 --> 34:00.140
For when the real kidnappers call.

34:00.165 --> 34:01.482
- Mother...
- Why are you so dumb?

34:01.509 --> 34:03.816
- Why don't you believe me!
- Mother!

34:04.024 --> 34:05.340
Dad!

34:07.257 --> 34:08.132
Sit down!

34:09.757 --> 34:10.880
God damn it!

34:14.507 --> 34:16.976
Hanh! Quick!
Bring me some bandages!

34:17.001 --> 34:19.235
Quick! Quit crying!

34:20.298 --> 34:21.063
Vinh!

34:26.499 --> 34:29.025
Why doesn’t he ever take my side?

34:29.798 --> 34:32.344
He was beaten up this morning!

34:32.514 --> 34:34.383
Dad’s hurting, too.

34:34.563 --> 34:36.688
We're all hurting...

34:41.132 --> 34:42.173
Don't cry.

34:43.173 --> 34:44.548
I'm sorry.

34:47.423 --> 34:48.632
I'm so sorry, honey.

35:14.842 --> 35:16.342
Mom...

35:17.257 --> 35:20.132
Why are we picking these flowers?

35:21.632 --> 35:22.923
For your sister.

35:28.757 --> 35:29.822
Does it hurt?

35:31.257 --> 35:33.054
- How about now?
- Yes!

36:45.132 --> 36:45.882
Who's there?

37:02.423 --> 37:03.421
Don't throw it at me!

37:03.446 --> 37:05.563
I don't have any money or drugs!

37:06.382 --> 37:07.460
What do you want?

37:07.782 --> 37:09.949
I wanna help you find Mai.

37:15.947 --> 37:17.612
MISSING: EVE OF TET
